WEBVTT

00:10:28.913 --> 00:10:32.543
on our continent will be put behind bars.

00:10:32.543 --> 00:10:34.170
This will not stop.

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:37.097
I'm going to carry on with this kind of journalism,

00:10:37.097 --> 00:10:40.525
because I know that when evil men destroy,

00:10:40.525 --> 00:10:42.513
good men must build and bind.

00:10:42.513 --> 00:10:43.786
Thank you very much.

00:10:43.786 --> 00:10:52.694
(Applause)

00:10:53.323 --> 00:10:55.021
Chris Anderson: Thank you. Thank you.

00:10:55.021 --> 00:10:57.269
I have some questions for you.

00:10:57.269 --> 00:11:01.499
How did you end up in jail? This was just a few weeks ago, I believe, yeah?